sequenceDiagram
    participant OS as Android system
    participant App as PantryWiseApp
    participant WM as WorkManager
    participant W as ExpirationWorker
    participant C as ExpirationChecker
    participant R as PantryRepository
    participant N as NotificationHelper
    participant U as User

    OS->>App: process starts (onCreate)
    App->>N: createChannel()
    App->>WM: enqueue unique periodic work, 1 day,<br/>first run at the next 09:00, policy KEEP
    Note over WM: repeats every day, only if the battery is not low
    WM->>W: doWork()
    W->>C: run(now)
    C->>R: active items that expired or expire within 3 days
    R-->>C: list
    alt the list is not empty
        C->>N: showExpirationNotification(list)
        N-->>U: notification (needs POST_NOTIFICATIONS)
        U->>N: taps it
        N->>OS: TaskStackBuilder: MainActivity then ShoppingListActivity
    else nothing to report
        C-->>W: 0 items, no notification
    end
    W-->>WM: success (retry up to 3 times if an exception occurs)
